     },
     "body": {
      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "I started looking at this during the Samvera Connect developer congress. It seemed that the basic functionality was already there in the code but it was not enabled. I began work on enabling it and adding a configuration property to enable it. ",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "Work is incomplete and relatively untested at this time. As there was no ticket before work commenced, the current branch holding the development is:",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "attrs": {
           "url": "https://github.com/fcrepo/fcrepo/compare/main...pearTreePidMinter"
          },
          "type": "inlineCard"
         },
         {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "I will look to get that renamed and align it with the ticket ID. ",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       }
      ],
      "type": "doc",
      "version": 1
     },
