     "body": "<p>I started looking at this during the Samvera Connect developer congress. It seemed that the basic functionality was already there in the code but it was not enabled. I began work on enabling it and adding a configuration property to enable it. </p>\n\n<p>Work is incomplete and relatively untested at this time. As there was no ticket before work commenced, the current branch holding the development is:</p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo/fcrepo/compare/main...pearTreePidMinter\" title=\"smart-link\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo/fcrepo/compare/main...pearTreePidMinter</a> </p>\n\n<p>I will look to get that renamed and align it with the ticket ID. </p>",
